  "name": "euro_customer_usd_workspace",
  "notes": [
    "A euro customer on a dollar workspace. €49/month from Mon Feb 2 2026; 2 seats from Tue Mar 10 (prorated); canceled at once Sun Apr 19 12:00.",
    "Each change converts the customer's new MRR at that day's ECB rate (base EUR) and stores the rate. A day without a rate uses the latest one before it.",
    "Feb 2: 4900 x 1.0870 = 5326.3 -> 5326, new +5326.",
    "Mar 10: 9800 x 1.0920 = 10701.6 -> 10702, expansion 10702 - 5326 = +5376 (original +4900).",
    "Apr 19 (Sunday, Friday Apr 17's 1.0990): churn -10702 (original -9800), back to exactly 0. MRR on May 31: 0."
  ],
